_reload_udev() {
  udevadm control --reload-rules || true
  # Apply the rule to a Quad Cortex that is already plugged in.
  udevadm trigger --action=change --subsystem-match=hidraw --property-match=ID_VENDOR_ID=152a || true
}

post_install() {
  _reload_udev
  cat <<'MSG'

Stompgate: Cortex Control for Omarchy (unofficial):
  1. Run as your user: stompgate-setup
  2. Start "Cortex Control" from the app launcher, or run: stompgate
  3. Check things any time with: stompgate-doctor

Neural DSP's installer and app are not included; setup uses your own copy.
Never update firmware through Cortex Control. Use Wi-Fi updates on the QC.

MSG
}

post_upgrade() {
  _reload_udev
}

post_remove() {
  udevadm control --reload-rules || true
  echo "Per-user files (prefix, Proton, Hyprland rule) are kept. Remove them first with stompgate-uninstall."
}
